{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings","id":766914,"title":"Something in the air (paranormal ramblings)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-16T01:01:02-08:00","id":766914,"title":"Something in the air (paranormal ramblings)","content":"So i was talking to az, and anotehr friend(in a seperate conversation on different days. they dont know each other)<br /> <br /> We are talking about the tension in in energy of the worlds. My best explanation of it is imagine a slack cord, now imagine that cord slowly being pulled on, pulled ever so slightly tighter over time. Now imagine that suddenly that slow increase in taughtness is becoming more frequent, and now you KNOW something is coming. Something big. A change, something terrible maybe depending on how you view it.<br /> <br /> Accompanying this is a restlessness, dreams and nightmares, pointing you to find something, and find it fast.<br /> <br /> The above is how i'm feeling it. I'm also feeling a calling from somewhere else, whispers from something just out of reach begging me to listen, but i cant understand whats being said, its important I know.<br /> <br /> Maybe i'm nuts maybe i'm not. But many people I know are mentioning this, we feel it, what it is we dont know for sure. But i'm taking a poll to see how many others feel it to. Maybe you feel it differently? IF so please describe it, I want to try to piece together what is going on, and with more info perhaps we can figure it out. <br /> <br /> So my questions:<br /> <br /> Are you feeling this?<br /> In what way is it manifesting?<br /> If you have those dreams, have you found what you were searching for?<br /> Do you believe in the paranormal, or is this coming as a shock to you to be noticing?<br /> Do you have a mental illness? (You dont have to answer this if its to personal, i'm just trying to rule out that only the crazies are feeling it.)<br /> Anything else you care to add or discuss, please feel free to throw it out there!<br /> <br /> I'm not joking, i sound insane. But hey... i figured why not poll some gamers about this as its interesting to see how people reply.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T02:10:14-08:00","id":766937,"title":"","content":"Does anyone else feel that tension? It's like the first time you know, in your gut, you're about to have a serious fight. Or that sudden tug when gravity leaves the equation on a rollercoaster. Do you feel like you're falling and grasping for something to hold onto? Are you running around looking for something? Feeling rushed or overwhelmed in your waking hours? <br /> <br /> ...if you have nightmares....<br /> <br /> ..have you seen people die.....more specifically, watched killing from the killer's point of view in your dream? No need to answer. Just think about it. <br /> <br /> You might not feel all of this....but...it's there.<br /> <br /> Whatever it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-16T14:42:54-08:00","id":767341,"title":"","content":"I've been pretty pretty down or depressed as of late. Plus, I haven't slept well in months....<br /> <br /> Not sure if that relates to this though...just saying...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T10:15:21-08:00","id":767919,"title":"","content":"Or its simply a good old case of Seasonal affective disorder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8325-asmael","name":"Asmael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8325_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-17T11:14:05-08:00","id":767958,"title":"","content":"Are you feeling this?<br /> <br /> Yeah, I little. I think I know what it is too. But I won't say just yet.<br /> In what way is it manifesting?<br /> I talked here before about how my family has a history of precognitive dreams. my dreams mostly predict unimportant scenes in my life that come true later, but they've coming true lately in a more rapid succession. We are picking up speed to something.<br /> If you have those dreams, have you found what you were searching for?<br /> Already said above<br /> Do you believe in the paranormal, or is this coming as a shock to you to be noticing?<br /> yes. I believe. I've talked before about my encounter with my last dog's ghost.<br /> Do you have a mental illness? (You don't have to answer this if its to personal, i'm just trying to rule out that only the crazies are feeling it.)<br /> Mild bipolar and high functioning autism, but nothing that would make me delusional.<br /> Anything else you care to add or discuss, please feel free to throw it out there!<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T21:44:29-08:00","id":774541,"title":"","content":"I'm feeling strange. This might be personal in nature, so others might not feel it. ..Something is wrong, though. I'm getting a &quot;something bad is gonna happen&quot; vibe, and I'm not thrilled with that, especially considering the global social climate right now. I have NO idea whether what I'm feeling is intensely personal or something that humanity as a whole will have to deal with, but I'm getting bad vibes. <br /> <br /> Anyone else seem to be drifting down (Painful) Memory Lane? It's NOT just my head. My entire family is feeling this... no fucking clue what it means.<br /> <br /> I didn't even feel THIS tension before the Paris terrorist attacks. I pray something horrible isn't looming like a shadow of ruin...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T13:42:01-08:00","id":774999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings#post766914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you feeling this?</div> </div> </div> </div>I haven't noticed anything like what you describe recently, though I have had similar feelings before. But for me it has been a while since I felt it. That's not to say I don't believe you and others have felt something. It's possible I'm not in-tune with what ever it is the same way you are.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings#post766914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In what way is it manifesting?</div> </div> </div> </div>As mentioned above, I haven't felt this recently. But when I have felt it in the past, it's similar to what you describe. The air feels thicker, heavier. There's an oppressive atmosphere and little things that would otherwise be mere annoyances set me off. When I was younger I would be brought to tears by seemingly nothing when it would happen.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings#post766914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you have those dreams, have you found what you were searching for?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've never really experienced what I believe to be meaningful dreams. I mean, I've had dreams within great personal meaning, but I think that's different than what you're asking about.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings#post766914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you believe in the paranormal, or is this coming as a shock to you to be noticing?</div> </div> </div> </div>It often comes as a surprise to those who know me, because I am very scientifically-inclined, but I do believe in the paranormal.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scelesta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings#post766914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have a mental illness? (You dont have to answer this if its to personal, i'm just trying to rule out that only the crazies are feeling it.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Nothing serious. My family and I have long suspected that I have ADD, but as a child my parents didn't want to put me on Ritalin, and as an adult I function well enough despite my attention and memory issues that I have never felt the need to seek treatment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T22:00:00-08:00","id":775252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Charlaquin, Has anything notable ever happened after one of these feeling of oppression?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it usually happens shortly before a large scale tragedy. A natural disaster or attack of some sort. But, like I said, I haven't felt it lately, despite the recent events that have occurred.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-27T00:34:19-08:00","id":775311,"title":"","content":"I deleted the previous version of my post I because I thought it was a little out there, but it seems Charlaquin replied to it right before I deleted it. so here it goes again<br /> <br /> Char, has anything noteworthy ever happen after these feelings of pressure?<br /> <br /> Azrael, I think ISIS is going to blow up the wrong (or right) middle eastern ruin and then something weird and magical will happen. Maybe magic gets strong enough that people believe in it again, like maybe the ruin is bottling up that energy. Of course it would be disruptive to life as we know it if something like that happens. so...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-04T22:41:45-08:00","id":780405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/766914-something-in-the-air-paranormal-ramblings?p=775311#post775311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Azrael, I think ISIS is going to blow up the wrong (or right) middle eastern ruin and then something weird and magical will happen. Maybe magic gets strong enough that people believe in it again, like maybe the ruin is bottling up that energy. Of course it would be disruptive to life as we know it if something like that happens. so...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Awesome. I was starting to worry.<br /> <img src=\"http://www.writeups.org/img/fiche/1472a.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}